/Pg 19 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
461 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 282 0 R
/E (The field of medical diagnostics has been significantly enhanced by advancements in computer vision, with deep learning emerging as the most transformative technology in recent years. Historically, computer-aided diagnosis relied on traditional machine learning methods that required manual, hand-crafted feature extraction. This process was often tedious, time )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
