483 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 284 0 R
/E (Unlike the acute infections above, Osteoarthritis is a chronic, degenerative disease. AI is proving valuable in automating the assessment of its severity from X-rays, a task that can be subjective when done manually. Research by Tiulpin et al. \(2018\) shows that deep learning systems can be trained to automatically identify key radiographic markers of osteoarthritis, such as joint space narrowing and osteophyte formation, enabling more consistent and objective disease monitoring. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
