569 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 290 0 R
/E (Our primary modelingstrategy was transfer learning. We adopted the EfficientNetB0 architecture, pre-trainedon the ImageNet dataset, as the foundational feature extractor. This approach allowedustoleverage the rich hierarchical features learned from a large-scale dataset. We instantiated thepre-trained base, froze the initial convolutional layers, and appended a custom classificationhead. This head was then fine-tuned on our medical datasets, enabling the model to adapt itsgeneralized knowledge to the specific nuances of radiographic images. )
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
