/P 313 0 R
/E (3. A Complete MLOps Lifecycle for Continuous Improvement: Our project )
/Pg 50 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
748 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 313 0 R
/E (demonstrated a full-circle MLOps framework. By integrating a feedback logging system with a safe retraining script \(fine_tune.py\), we created a platform that is not static but is designed to learn and improve over time from real-world feedback, a critical feature for the long-term viability of any clinical AI tool. )
/Pg 50 0 R
/K [5]
>>
