759 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 314 0 R
/E (This research successfully demonstrated the feasibility and effectiveness of a novel, intelligent multi-agent AI architecture for multi-disease medical image analysis. We designed and built a complete, end-to-end system that is not only diagnostically accurate but also interpretable, secure, and designed for continuous improvement. The project successfully addressed the identified research gap by creating a versatile, multi-agent platform that mimics a clinical escalation workflow to manage uncertainty. While further clinical validation is required, this work represents a significant step forward and provides a robust foundation for the future development of safe and reliable AI-powered tools for healthcare in Ghana and beyond. )
/Pg 51 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
